PHASE 15 — Practice Words, Flashcards, Progress, Streaks, Badges, and Badge Settings

Goal:
Build learning engagement features.

What to build:
- Practice words list.
- Flashcard review system.
- Spaced repetition basics.
- Activity log.
- Progress dashboard.
- Streaks.
- Badge settings.
- Student badges.
- Parent view of child badges/progress.

Flashcard logic:
- Got it → review in 3 days
- Almost → review in 1 day
- Missed it → review today/tomorrow

Activity log sources:
- Homework submitted
- Scenario submitted
- Review/test taken
- Flashcards reviewed
- Session completed

Badge settings:
Owner can manage:
- name
- description
- icon/emoji
- trigger type
- required value
- active/inactive
- display order
- visibility
- color/style

Default badges:
- First Step
- 5-Day Streak
- 10-Day Streak
- 30-Day Streak
- 10 Sessions
- 25 Sessions
- Vocab Builder
- Speaking Star
- Perfect Week
- First Level Check Completed

Pages:
- /student/progress
- /student/flashcards
- /student/badges
- /parent/child/[id]/progress
- /parent/child/[id]/badges
- /owner/badges/settings

Acceptance criteria:
- Practice words can be added by Owner.
- Student reviews flashcards.
- Next review date updates.
- Activity log records actions.
- Streak calculates correctly.
- Badges are awarded based on active settings.
- Parent sees child progress.

Manual test checklist:
- Add practice words.
- Review flashcards.
- Confirm due dates.
- Trigger a badge.
- Change badge setting.
- Confirm disabled badge does not award.

Stop condition:
Stop here. Test this phase before continuing.
